{"id":"wb-7-575","name":"宋六陵","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"宋六陵","text":"宋六陵，或称南宋六陵，是位于中华人民共和国浙江省绍兴市越城区富盛镇的南宋六座帝王陵墓（另外包含一座宋徽宗的陵墓）。原为浙江省文物保护单位。2013年3月，由国务院公布为第七批全国重点文物保护单位（古墓葬）。\n七座帝王陵墓分别是：\n\n宋徽宗的永祐陵\n宋高宗的永思陵\n宋孝宗的永阜陵\n宋光宗的永崇陵\n宋宁宗的永茂陵\n宋理宗的永穆陵\n宋度宗的永绍陵","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AE%8B%E5%85%AD%E9%99%B5","revisionId":93403815,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93403815","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/53c1cc53b5314777f4cca631.jpg","title":"20240529_Yongsi_and_Yongfu_Mausoleums.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20240529_Yongsi_and_Yongfu_Mausoleums.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/20/20240529_Yongsi_and_Yongfu_Mausoleums.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Yumeto","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Mausoleums of Gaozong (Zhao Gou) and Xiaozong (Zhao Shen) of Song","width":320,"height":240}}